 38 | a <=2> (b <=2> c)          | NEAR(a b c, 2)                       | t          | t
 39 | a <=1> b*                  | "a b*"                               | t          | t
 40 | a~1 <-> b                  | ('a'~1 <-> 'b')                      | t          | t
 41 | a:A <2> b:BC               | ('a':A <2> 'b':BC)                   | t          | t
 42 | /x.y/ <-> b                | (/x.y/ <-> 'b')                      | t          | t
